    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry / typographic + graphic research platform founded by Fabiola Mejia, a Costa Rican type designer (San Jose). Typefaces incl. Actual, Anacoreta, Montiac, RYM, Raiz, Segueta, plus design artifacts; sells licenses. Founder is senior/specialist: Type@Cooper Condensed (2017), MA Typeface Design TypeMedia NL (2019), also works remotely with Dinamo. Essentially a one-designer foundry (Size 1). Capabilities: Type design (core) + Graphic design (artifacts/explorations). Canonical site set to supercontinente.com (prior URL pointed at /mobile/).",
